# CLAUDE.md is the local operating note for this working copy: how to run the
# suite through WSL on a machine where Application Control blocks unsigned
# binaries, and which rules of this project are not up for negotiation. It is
# not documentation for anybody who clones this, and this repository is public,
# so it stays out of the tree rather than relying on nobody typing `git add .`.
CLAUDE.md
